The samurai type character comes packed and ready to use with two swords...
the katana, and a shorter sword (beginning with a w).  These are usually paired
to form a weapon set called the Daisho (the long and the short), which are used
at the same time in combat (see TMNT-Paladium books).  In fact, Leonardo (the
Turtle for those of you too mature to relate yourselves with them) uses these.
This pair of weapons makes the samurai class potentially powerful... as it is,
it seems that the shorter sword is wasted.

May I suggest that hack have (especially for the ninja style samurai) an option
for using paired weapons (any combination of 1-H wepons).

I am going to play around with rogue to get it to simulate TMNT, and will see
how this works out myself.  


